The decoder is a C port of the CELP decoder in jr-conventional-line-radio-receiver
(https://github.com/soltia48/jr-conventional-line-radio-receiver, crates/jr-voice/src/celp,
commit dfc7440), whose fixed-point DSP and tables come from mcelp-codec
(https://github.com/soltia48/mcelp-codec). Both are distributed under the MIT license
reproduced below; the port and its changes are under the same license.

